# Local-only context for Claude sessions (Claude Code, Cowork, etc.)
CLAUDE.md

# Everything under .claude/ is local-only and private, with one deliberate
# exception: the ProjectOS Premium Build skill link, which the canonical
# v1.1.0 layout expects to be tracked so a fresh clone passes project-os-check.
# Git cannot re-include a path inside an excluded directory, so the directory
# itself is not excluded; each level is narrowed instead. Anything new under
# .claude/ is ignored by default, including new files inside .claude/skills/.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/premium-build

# Internal working notes — candid self-critique, not for the public repo
AUDIT.md